# Black Duo: a second pan on the nine black keys between castanets and the Gu, in a scale that goes with
# the first, in its register
# (params: 24 Scale 25 Key 26 Black 27 Duo 28 Duo level; duoI: the second pan's note I, 0 its ding)
wait 1600
tap SEL
expect view 7
# off (Kit): the Duo page's Duo knobs do nothing
tap SEL
expect view 8
spin K1 1
expect par27 0
wait 50
shot duo_off.png
tap SEL
spin K4 1
expect par26 1
wait 50
shot duo_keys.png
# D Kurd's best match: D Celtic, its ding the first's (D3)
expect duocount >3
expect duo0 5000
expect duo1 5700
expect duo2 6000
expect duo8 7200
# the end keys: castanets (the left) and the Gu (the right)
key b10 down
wait 25
expect cavity >5
key b10 up
expect duokey0 -1
expect duokey10 -1
# the keys between play the second pan, laid out as the white keys are: Pan, its ding in the middle
# (b5), its fields alternating outward, right first: D Celtic D3 | A3 C4 D4 E4 F4 G4 A4 C5
expect duokey5 5000
expect duokey6 5700
expect duokey4 6000
expect duokey7 6200
expect duokey3 6400
expect duokey8 6500
expect duokey2 6700
expect duokey9 6900
expect duokey1 7200
tapkey b7
wait 30
expect note6200 >3
tapkey b4
wait 30
expect note6000 >3
wait 50
shot duo_play.png
# Pan rev: left first; Linear: low to high, the ding on the left
expect view 7
spin K1 1
expect par23 1
expect duokey5 5000
expect duokey4 5700
expect duokey6 6000
expect duokey2 6500
expect duokey9 7200
spin K1 1
expect par23 2
expect duokey1 5000
expect duokey4 6200
expect duokey9 7200
spin K1 -2
expect par23 0
# Duo level 0: the second pan barely there
tap SEL
expect view 8
spin K2 -80
expect par28 0
tapkey b9
wait 30
expect note6900 <15
spin K2 80
expect par28 80
tap SEL
expect view 7
# another match: the Duo page's first knob steps through them, each in the first pan's notes
tap SEL
expect view 8
spin K1 1
expect par27 1
wait 50
shot duo_next.png
spin K1 40
expect par27 >1
spin K1 -60
expect par27 0
# a new scale (or key) starts the match afresh
spin K1 2
expect par27 2
tap SEL
spin K2 1
expect par24 1
expect par27 0
turn PRESET 1
expect par27 0
expect dropped 0
